    "title": "她的房间",
    "description": "原画来自  画师JW\r\n更多画师作品可以关注他的主页https://space.bilibili.com/330094126\r\n禁止商用，转载须注明出处及原画信息\r\n\r\n大家好，我是大污师，首先感谢大家这几年的支持和厚爱，我有些话想说一下，也许你们注意到了，近些日子我的壁纸产量放缓了，我的收入并不高，还在使用五年前的电脑进行创作。\r\n制作壁纸几乎占据了我所有的业余时间，有时还需要熬夜，最近我的第二个宝宝降生了，我不知道还能在这里坚持多久。有条件想支持一下的朋友可以考虑捐助一下下。\r\n再次感谢大家的支持\r\n[url=https://steamuserimages-a.akamaihd.net/ugc/1664606352306261863/E37DB5F74D34430C703495BA70FB63C9F39CDF20/]二维码捐赠 [/url]\r\nHello everyone, I am DWS, first of all, thank you for your support and love over the years, I would like to say something, maybe you have noticed that my wallpaper production has declined recently, my income is not high, I still use the computer five years ago to create.\r\nWallpaper making takes up almost all of my spare time, and sometimes I have to stay up late. Recently my second baby was born, and I don't know how much longer I can stay here. Conditionally want to support a friend can consider a donation.\r\nThanks again for your support\r\n[url=https://paypal.me/DWS2018?locale.x=zh_XC] PAYPAL [/url]",
